#: healthcare/healthcare/doctype/patient/patient.json
msgid ""
"If \"Link Customer to Patient\" is checked in Healthcare Settings and an existing Customer is not selected "
"then, a Customer will be created for this Patient for recording transactions in Accounts module."
msgstr ""
"Si \"Vincular cliente con paciente\" está marcado en Ajustes de salud y no se selecciona un cliente "
"existente, se creará un cliente para este paciente para registrar las transacciones en el módulo de "
"Cuentas."

#: healthcare/healthcare/doctype/healthcare_settings/healthcare_settings.js:108
msgid ""
"If checked, a customer will be created for every Patient. Patient Invoices will be created against this "
"Customer. You can also select existing Customer while creating a Patient. This field is checked by default."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, se creará un cliente para cada paciente. Las facturas del paciente se crearán a nombre de este"
" cliente. También puede seleccionar un cliente existente al crear un paciente. Este campo está marcado de "
"forma predeterminada."

#: healthcare/healthcare/doctype/healthcare_settings/healthcare_settings.json
msgid ""
"If checked, a customer will be created, mapped to Patient.\n"
"Patient Invoices will be created against this Customer. You can also select existing Customer while "
"creating Patient."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, se creará un cliente vinculado al paciente.\n"
"Las facturas del paciente se crearán a nombre de este cliente. También puede seleccionar un cliente "
"existente al crear el paciente."

#: healthcare/healthcare/doctype/healthcare_settings/healthcare_settings.json
